# Rust build output
target/
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# .NET build output (legacy protocol reference)
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Prebuilt binaries — never commit build artifacts
rust/prototype/
*.exe
*.dll
*.pdb
*.lib

# Wand-owned assets that must not be redistributed:
#  - catalog.json is Wand/WeMod catalog data
#  - assets/art holds downloaded game artwork
#  - reference/ contains Wand application code kept only as a local reference
rust/ui/assets/catalog.json
rust/ui/assets/art/
rust/reference/

# Local runtime output
*.log
*.tmp
bench_results.local.json

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
